        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.47.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esk 47:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yna 7:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ngo 22:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yintegho pögho söpon Yerusalem osiswechoni. Yintoy lö karerana kutang nanampa Paryan, kuyinta chinö kutang nanampa Kwen. Yintoy lenyoni osiwo kömöy nko pengat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku nyu ECHOTYON, pöytoghinto ngwïny kïmïkul akïlïku nyinte Tororöt onkït akesoghöy nyinte onkït.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku kore kïtangogh mpöghogh kïngeta Kepa, nyo mi Yerusalem kuntoka ntökwit Rimon nyo mi kumporö. Wölo töpo kanasyanta Yerusalem ato syolote kïngeta Kuka Penchamen, kuwer ato kimi asistanka nayatu Ananel nyo kiwo chak ntökwit wölo kïryöko dipay* pö pöytoghin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ngo 22:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Möngisïyi pich Yerusalem ompö kalya ompöwölo melö tökïchïpote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ompö pich cho kipka kïporyeghö Yerusalem, achï nyörilwok cho nyoru. Nïniot kïmi takol akï nïniö ngölyepwö ompö kutïwekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiro ECHOTYON chane asisoni mïghö nyo wow ntökïporyeghö kegh akwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poryot pipö Yuda atökïrip kanasyanta Yerusalem ompö pung. Kisupuy sïkönöto pipö koros löwïr cho le pöröris pö Yuda. Kisupuy koltin nko silpa nko sïro cho möngörï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nömöy tïkwïl sömewö nyo gha angoletin nko nyumpun* nko tamasay nko sïkïröy nko kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo sapul ompö kestoni pung pö Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
